<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia bidding in Pakistan wheat tender.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia bidding in Pakistan wheat tender.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-01-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Australia will bid in a Pakistan tender for 312,000 tonnes of white wheat, expected to be called on Sunday, a spokesman for the Australian Wheat Board said.</p>
<p>The tender was for U.S. or Australian wheat and Australian Standard White (ASW) would fill the bill, AWB spokesman Alec Nichol told Reuters. The U.S. anticipated that it would get &quot;some of that market,&quot; he said.</p>
<p>Bidding was in a competitive tender, Nichol said.</p>
<p>-- Sydney Newsroom 61-2 9373-1800</p>
</text>
